$ python3 scripts/compare-scenes.py --help

usage: compare-scenes.py [-h] --times TIMES [TIMES ...] --out OUT
                         [--dotnet DOTNET] [--max-error MAX_ERROR]
                         [--mean-error MEAN_ERROR]
                         baseline candidate chart

Render identical chart times with two actual application builds. Writes paired
PPMs, amplified difference images, candidate diagnostics and a machine-
readable summary into a NEW output directory. Never edits the chart. The
baseline may be the user's pre-refactor SDL_GPU build or an older reference.
Requires a supported local GPU. A saved screenshot alone is not a passing
test.

positional arguments:
  baseline
  candidate
  chart

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --times TIMES [TIMES ...]
  --out OUT
  --dotnet DOTNET
  --max-error MAX_ERROR
  --mean-error MEAN_ERROR


exit_code=0
